      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've seen this happen when you're driving resolution to higher values (1080p) but aren't pushing bitrate hard enough. AVPro doesn't seem to like that.\nCan you try reducing resolution or increasing bitrate and see if that helps?\nFor 1080p/30fps I'd suggest at least 4500kbit.",
