  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Since the last maybe 3 or 4 VRChat versions, AVPro RTSP streams seem to hitch like crazy. For example, when the menu gets opened or someone loads an avatar, but! not only that. Also if you have more than ~(20 - 40) Avatars shown, the video starts massively glitching out, stuttering, now framerate, complete freezes etc. \nIt never used to do that before, I've validated with VRCDN that this is not a streaming server / streamer issue either. It is caused by something in the client.\nThis is currently really bad for events, I hope something can be done about this",
